    <p class="mt-3 text-sm"><a class="underline text-[var(--sage-deep)]" href="/blog/sommers-bend/">Sommers Bend</a></p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm"><a class="underline text-[var(--sage-deep)]" href="/blog/temecula-neighborhood-guide/">A local’s guide to Temecula neighborhoods</a></p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm"><a class="underline text-[var(--sage-deep)]" href="/blog/">Back to the blog</a></p>
    <Comments pageId="paseo-del-sol" />
  </main>
</Layout>
